On Wednesday 21 July 2004 07:19 pm, Peter H. wrote:
> If I do use gnome-session and then minimize an open window I can't retrieve
> it anymore no matter what combination of ctrl, alt, mouse clicks and Fx
> keys I use. They have just vanished. They are not indicated on the taskbar
> as well.

Gnome and KDE tend to copy Windows in that when you hit Alt+Tab, it should 
switch between programs. If that doesn't work you should be able to change 
the key combo in the settings options.

